Generic single-database configuration for the worker service.

The database URL is read from the DATABASE_URL environment variable (see migrations/env.py).
The worker uses the asyncpg driver at runtime; Alembic coerces the URL to psycopg2 for
synchronous migrations, so ensure psycopg2-binary is installed.

Usage:
    export DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://agentobs:agentobs@localhost:5432/agentobs
    alembic upgrade head
